 ZSQL - Z80 SQLite on Spectrum ==============================  zsql> CREATE TABLE mara   (matnr, mtart, meins, maktx) OK  zsql> INSERT INTO mara VALUES   100-100 FERT ST Pump Assy   100-300 FERT ST Valve Unit   200-100 ROH  KG Raw Steel   200-200 HALB KG Steel Plate OK (4 rows)  zsql> SELECT * FROM mara   WHERE mtart = FERT  matnr   |mtart|meins|maktx --------|-----|-----|---------- 100-100 |FERT |ST   |Pump Assy 100-300 |FERT |ST   |Valve Unit  2 rows. SQL on Z80!